ASSEMBLY of the k=11 tail:
  (1) non-primitive families: PZ dilation-invariant => reduce to primitive (exhaustive range).
  (2) primitive diam <= 17: EXHAUSTIVE exact, min PZ = 0.346788 (block) >= bar (+0.0156; B_3 +0.0735).
  (3) primitive diam > 17, far <= E[W]^2 (SPREAD, majority): sharp near/far PZ >= 0.53 >> bar
