         exact near delivers the "+0.02 needed" as +0.20).
  (4) primitive diam > 17, far > E[W]^2 (residual): RARE & shrinking (695@20 -> 7@30 -> ~0@50),
      min PZ 0.39->0.49, all >> compact min -- finite-checkable / same decorrelation lemma's complement.
  REMAINING: the far <= E[W]^2 decorrelation lemma (mac-mini's, now with +0.20 room not razor +0.02)
